<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice | Twin Tech-sudo" description="How Twin Tech-sudo handles website enquiries, analytics and personal information.">
  <SiteHeader /><main><article class="insight"><header><span class="page-kicker">// PRIVACY</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>A plain-English summary of how this website handles information.</p><div><time datetime="2026-09-30">Last updated 30 September 2026</time></div></header><div class="insight-body"><section><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The current contact form opens your email application. Information is sent by email and is used only to respond to your enquiry, prepare a proposal, deliver requested services, or meet legal obligations.</p></section><section><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>Non-essential analytics are not loaded unless consent is obtained. When analytics are enabled, this notice and the consent interface will identify the provider, purpose and retention period.</p></section><section><h2>Your rights</h2><p>UK data protection law may give you rights to access, correct, erase or restrict use of your personal information. Contact hello@twintech-sudo.co.uk to make a request.</p></section></div></article></main><SiteFooter />
</SiteLayout>
